@Semana13_HostAddress = http://localhost:5239

### ---------- Grade: CRUD ----------

### Listar grados activos
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/grades
Accept: application/json

### Obtener grado por ID (404 si está eliminado)
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/grades/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear grado
POST {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/grades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tercero",
  "description": "Tercer grado"
}

### Actualizar grado (404 si está eliminado)
PUT {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/grades/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tercero A",
  "description": "Tercer grado, sección A"
}

### Eliminar grado (lógico: IsDeleted = 1)
DELETE {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/grades/3

### ---------- Course: CRUD ----------

### Listar cursos activos
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Accept: application/json

### Obtener curso por ID (404 si está eliminado)
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/courses/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear curso
POST {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Quimica",
  "credit": 3
}

### Actualizar curso (404 si está eliminado)
PUT {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/courses/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Quimica General",
  "credit": 4
}

### Eliminar curso (lógico: IsDeleted = 1)
DELETE {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/courses/6

### ---------- Búsquedas ----------

### 1. Estudiantes por nombre, apellido o email (apellido DESC)
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/students?search=ana
Accept: application/json

### 2. Estudiantes por nombre y grado (curso activo mayor DESC, sin curso al final)
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/students/by-grade?name=a&gradeId=1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Matrículas por nombre de curso (curso ASC, apellido ASC)
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/by-course?courseName=mat
Accept: application/json

### 4. Matrículas por grado (curso ASC, apellido ASC)
GET {{Semana13_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/by-grade?gradeId=1
Accept: application/json
